    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a coarse fabric of silk, of mohair and wool, or of these mixed with silk; often stiffened with gum (OED grogram) | a coarse fabric of silk, of mohair and wool, or of these mixed with silk; often stiffened with gum (OED s.v. grogram) | a coarse fabric of silk, of mohair and wool, or of these mixed with silk; often stiffened with gum (OED s.v. grogram); grogram (sic) chamlets attested in OED s.v. grogram 3 and camlet n. but not defined</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
